OL,3,GNEWSANo evidence parking site fire was 
OL,4,Aarson - police                         
OL,6,FNo evidence has been found that        
OL,7,Fsuggests a fire at a third-party car   
OL,8,Fparking facility used by Gatwick       
OL,9,FAirport passengers was started         
OL,10,Fdeliberately, police say.              
OL,12,FAbout 140 vehicles were thought to have
OL,13,Fbeen destroyed at Caldyne Business Park
OL,14,Fin Wallage Lane, Rowfant, which broke  
OL,15,Fout shortly after 21:00 BST on 22      
OL,16,FAugust.                                
OL,18,FSussex Police said it has concluded its
OL,19,Finvestigation, and two men who had     
OL,20,Fpreviously been arrested will face no  
OL,21,Ffurther action.                        
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
